      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this beautifully extended 3-bedroom / 1-bathroom mid-terrace family to the market ideally located on Fernwood Avenue, Springfield, Dublin 24. Situated in a quiet, mature and family-friendly neighbourhood this one is walking distance of a wide range of amenities including schools such as St. Mark's Community School and Sacred Heart National School, shopping centres like The Square Tallaght, and leisure facilities including Tallaght Stadium, Tymon Park, and the Civic Theatre. Public transport is easily accessible with multiple Dublin Bus routes and the nearby LUAS Red Line providing quick access to the city centre and surrounding areas. The M50 motorway is also just minutes away, making commuting a breeze.\r\n\r\nBright, airy & most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 95 sqm compromises of entrance porch, large living room with under stairs space, dining room with stove fireplace and fully fitted kitchen. On the first floor you have three double bedrooms and the main family bathroom that comes fully tiled.\r\nTo the rear of the property you have a private & enclosed garden of the lowest maintenance which comes with a highly sought after west facing orientation making it a sun trap and perfect for relaxing on them long summer evenings whilst the front provides ample off-street parking.\r\n\r\nNo. 19 Fernwood Avenue comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years with plenty of refurbishments done in recent times and finished with top quality fixtures & fittings. It also has plenty of additional features such as generous living space, three double bedrooms, ample storage, fully fitted kitchen and gas fired central heating to name but a few.\r\n\r\nThis one really needs to be viewed to see the sheer quality of home on offer and homes like this rarely come to the market in this area. We expect it will cause quite a stir around a wide range of buyers, its perfect for any first-time buyer looking to get on the property ladder or any investor looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area - contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today!\r\n\r\nAdditional features;\r\n- c. 95 sqm\r\n- BER C\r\n- Extended to the front and rear\r\n- 3 Bed / 1 Bath\r\n- Mid-terrace family home\r\n- Great condition throughout\r\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom\r\n- Recently refurbished throughout\r\n- Bright and airy living accommodation\r\n- Extra spacious layout\r\n- Entrance porch\r\n- Large living room\r\n- Separate dining room with fireplace\r\n- Fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Carpet stairs & landing\r\n- Three generous bedrooms\r\n- Main family bathroom fully tiled\r\n- Top quality blinds\r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Top quality flooring\r\n- Sunny west facing rear\r\n- Lowest maintenance rear garden\r\n- Private & enclosed\r\n- Parking to the front of the property\r\n- Schools within walking distance\r\n- Local amenities on your doorstep\r\n- Luas within arm's reach\r\n- Exclusive & sought-after area\r\n- Prime for first time buyers and families looking to settle roots in sought after area\r\n\r\nDirections D24 R928"
      },
      {
